    airo:evidenceText "Quebec man sentenced to prison for creating AI-generated, synthetic child pornography" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3215" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/03f1a811a388> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A man in Quebec, Canada has been sentenced to three years in prison for using artificial intelligence (AI) to generate images of child pornography — the first ruling of its kind in the country." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7939" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/068d33fcbbf5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Steven Larouche, 61, pleaded guilty to creating at least seven videos using \"deepfake technology,\" which uses algorithms to perform face swaps to create the illusion or someone saying or doing something they didn’t say or do." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3217" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/128d8e5b3b1e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Provincial court judge Benoit explained that this was the first case in Canada of this kind and that he’s concerned that future criminals will use this same technology to put children’s faces from pictures uploaded to various social media platforms onto videos of other children who were sexually assaulted." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7945" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/215af933bdfa> a airo:Evidence ;
