    airo:evidenceText "Steven Larouche, 61, of Sherbrooke, Que., pleaded guilty to creating at least seven videos with so-called deepfake technology, which is used to superimpose the face of an individual onto the body of another person." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6291" .

