<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1c99d850170c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A man in Quebec, Canada has been sentenced to three years in prison for using artificial intelligence (AI) to generate images of child pornography." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3218" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5a3210cba47c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In February, PetaPixel reported on a computer programmer who was arrested in Spain for creating child porn images with AI software." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7939" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7a9f1cbeeaa1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Introduced by Republican lawmaker Tri Ta, of Westminster, California, the legislation aims to punish people up to $1,000, or a year in jail, if they distribute “deepfake” porn depicting an individual without their consent." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6292" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ab2c130d46d4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Introduced by Republican lawmaker Tri Ta, of Westminster, California, the legislation aims to punish people up to $1,000, or a year in jail, if they distribute \"deepfake\" porn depicting an individual without their consent." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3217" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c60f57454678> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vasileia Karasavva, a masters student in clinical psychology at the University of British Columbia who co-wrote a 2021 paper on the threat of deepfake pornography, said the technological bar for creating videos with the technology keeps getting lower." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6295" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d2eda01b97ed> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A Quebec Court judge has sentenced a Quebec man to prison for using artificial intelligence to produce synthetic images of child pornography." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3215" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e710cb5fae96> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Steven Larouche, the man in question, pleaded guilty to the creation of several deepfake videos as well as possessing over 545,000 files of child pornography---a portion of which he sent to other people---according to the Canadian Press." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3216" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fb916db316be> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Steven Larouche, 61, of Sherbrooke, Que., pleaded guilty to creating at least seven videos with so-called deepfake technology, which is used to superimpose the face of an individual onto the body of another person." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3219" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6ab7cdb74804> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Steven Larouche, 61 has pled guilty." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3220" .

