<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/025bc657787d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Steven Larouche, the man in question, pleaded guilty to the creation of several deepfake videos as well as possessing over 545,000 files of child pornography." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7945" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0da2a7b517d1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Stephen Sauer, the director of Cybertip.ca, said that while there have been earlier cases of people creating synthetic images of child sexual abuse in more rudimentary ways, such as with Photoshop, this may be the first time someone in Canada has been sentenced for creating material using deepfake technology." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6295" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/43155a732650> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Provincial court judge Benoit Gagnon sentenced Steven Larouche, 61, to eight years in prison for a series of sex crimes, including possession of child pornography." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3215" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e30caabc0d1d> a airo:Evidence ;
